{"game": "back-4-blood", "language": "english", "appid": 924970, "month": "2025-11", "window": 4, "start_date": 1763942400, "end_date": 1764547199, "month_true_total": 160, "quota": 5, "returned": 5, "pulled_at": "2026-08-29 20:54:17 Pacific Daylight Time", "reviews": [{"recommendationid": "212167413", "author": {"steamid": "76561198432080526", "personaname": "Derrame", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/profiles/76561198432080526/", "num_games_owned": 94, "num_reviews": 81, "playtime_forever": 20365, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 20327, "last_played": 1769016601, "avatar": "59c6b25b9118be2636d4afbf6b2c520f560b4dd7"}, "language": "english", "review": "Very fun, alone or with players\nlots of maps and weapons\n", "timestamp_created": 1764537323, "timestamp_updated": 1764537323, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 10, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": "0.561468541622161865", "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": false, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1634050800", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "212093063", "author": {"steamid": "76561198145240716", "personaname": "saco", "persona_status": "online", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/id/shacopol/", "num_games_owned": 86, "num_reviews": 12, "playtime_forever": 880, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 880, "last_played": 1761053331, "avatar": "cde80f50ba4fa74abbd3f7b2b44354ef8e3b1685"}, "language": "english", "review": "A decent replacement for L4D. Nice replayability and stages. Buy on sale though, definitely not 60 buckaroos worth of gameplay.", "timestamp_created": 1764530038, "timestamp_updated": 1764530038, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 2, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": "0.509803950786590576", "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1634050800", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "212019748", "author": {"steamid": "76561197962664348", "personaname": "usantahl", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/id/usantahl/", "num_games_owned": 0, "num_reviews": 5, "playtime_forever": 10958, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 4450, "deck_playtime_at_review": 4450, "last_played": 1786475530, "avatar": "c7fba12ac1ba8af8228139d12698b11452fb52e3"}, "language": "english", "review": "When I play L4d2, I laugh a lot. \nWhen I play b4b, I don’t laugh at all. \n\nL4d2 is one of a kind that can’t be replicated. \nB4b is an FPS for your zombie killing fix. All for the price of a latte in NYC.", "timestamp_created": 1764522835, "timestamp_updated": 1764524092, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 5, "votes_funny": 1, "weighted_vote_score": "0.564586341381072998", "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": true, "app_release_date": "1634050800", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "211999112", "author": {"steamid": "76561198078923677", "personaname": "Kelvin [Linux]", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/id/kelvinilla/", "num_games_owned": 450, "num_reviews": 11, "playtime_forever": 4746, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 44, "playtime_at_review": 764, "deck_playtime_at_review": 764, "last_played": 1788022058, "avatar": "ffdad1c8fadb36063bbb08da5a51cd56cba8e0c2"}, "language": "english", "review": "I think Back 4 Blood got a lot of flack at launch because many fans were expecting another Left 4 Dead. I skipped it back then for that reason, but trying it now, I’m genuinely glad I gave it a chance. It feels like a modern take on the L4D formula—not necessarily better, but definitely fresher in ways I appreciate.\n\nBack 4 Blood adds features you’d expect from a modern shooter: iron sights, character perks, a card-based loadout system, and a light looter-shooter loop with constantly dropping weapons and attachments. The progression and grind may not appeal to L4D veterans, but personally, I enjoy having builds to tweak and rewards to unlock.\n\nThe AI companions aren’t as sharp as L4D’s. They seem contractually obligated to run into your line of fire, and if human players split up, they may teleport back and forth between them. \n\nWhat I do miss most is the sense of threat in L4D. The Tank still feels genuinely scary to me—the screen shake, the music, the weight of it. I never felt that same dread from enemies in B4B. But if you’re in the mood for a more relaxed, shoot-things-and-have-fun kind of horror-themed game, that’s not necessarily a bad thing.\n\nOverall, if you enjoy the L4D style but want something that feels new, not as stressful, with modern mechanics and satisfying gunplay, Back 4 Blood is absolutely worth picking up.", "timestamp_created": 1764520566, "timestamp_updated": 1764520566, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 1, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": 0.5, "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": true, "app_release_date": "1634050800", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "211820999", "author": {"steamid": "76561199359345520", "personaname": "TIGAS TITE", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/profiles/76561199359345520/", "num_games_owned": 0, "num_reviews": 1, "playtime_forever": 32192, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 9829, "last_played": 1784373667, "avatar": "9d88a49ee245bdf18df01c57314e64716d2eb2e2"}, "language": "english", "review": "Good for 4 people", "timestamp_created": 1764485079, "timestamp_updated": 1764485079, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 1, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": 0.5, "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_fo